1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,310
Every leaf on the old oak had fallen.
All but one.

2
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:09,839
Every morning, on her way to school,
she checked on it.

3
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:14,309
The wind tried. The rain tried.

4
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:17,402
It held on.

5
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:23,873
Then, one still, cold morning,
it let go.

6
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:29,915
She was right there.

7
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:36,290
She pressed it in her favourite book.

8
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:41,184
It's still there.
